# Sprint 2 — Automated Database Backup artifacts (Owner, 2026-08-08).
# Direktori khusus untuk databaseBackup.js/databaseRestoreVerify.js — berisi
# dump .sql, manifest .manifest.json, dan log terstruktur .log.jsonl.
# Diignore sebagai SATU DIREKTORI (bukan hanya pola ekstensi *.sql di atas)
# supaya manifest/log yang berisi informasi operasional (walau sudah
# diredaksi dari credential) tidak pernah ter-commit tidak sengaja.
backups/database/

# Sprint 2 — Uploads (Filesystem) Backup artifacts, S2-01C (Owner decision
# S2-D01, 2026-08-16). Direktori khusus untuk databaseBackupUploads.js/
# uploadsRestoreVerify.js — berisi archive .tar.gz, manifest .manifest.json,
# dan log .log.jsonl. Diignore sebagai SATU DIREKTORI, sibling dari
# backups/database/ di atas, dengan alasan identik: mencegah archive berisi
# dokumen pemerintah persisten (walau metadata manifest sudah bebas nama
# file individual/kredensial) ter-commit tidak sengaja.
backups/uploads/

# Sprint 20 — S20-DEFER-SECRET-01/02: bounded ignore protection for
# private-key / PKCS#12 material (CEA/Owner mandate
# ePELARA-MP-S20-BI-FGS-20260822, Section 6E). This prevents FUTURE
# accidental (re)commit of key/cert material. It does NOT untrack the
# four already-tracked files (backend/cert.pem, backend/certs/cert.p12,
# backend/key.pem, backend/private-key.pem) — that requires
# `git rm --cached`, an index/staging operation explicitly deferred to a
# separately authorized controlled staging phase (staging is not
# authorized under this mandate). Historical exposure of these four
# files in git history is unaffected by this rule and remains an open
# item (see S20-DEFER-SECRET-01/02).
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
certs/
